{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act17d0_level_act17d0_st01",
  "groupId": "act17d0",
  "stageId": "act17d0_st01",
  "title": "拉馬克行動",
  "storyCode": "OD-ST-1",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_st01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6198aa7a7ec07312f03f8ef49fe1da731fc0b55459189fd17d078e458a4c97a4",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "我們已進入磁山二號，重複一遍，我們已進入磁山二號。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Iana、Ela，你們那邊情況如何？完畢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "一切照舊，我們很快就能完成收尾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "完畢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Ela？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Iana，準備接敵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "已就位！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "複製器已開啟！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "地雷部署！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "如果情報無誤，這就是最後一批了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "我們處理完畢後就向你們靠攏！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Gówno！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Ela通訊完畢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "情況就是這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "放心交給波蘭人吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "我已經聽到雷電地雷觸發的聲音了，她們會沒事的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "而你，Blitz，把注意力放回警戒上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "聽你的，女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "注意儀錶讀數，情報顯示這個建築物裡有封存的核廢料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Frost，我們離目標還有多遠？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "穿過前面的檢查站和材料儲藏室，就是主實驗室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "無人機顯示雇傭兵在檢查站及周邊建造了簡易工事 。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "沒有掩體，沒有死角，入口位置堵死，周邊佈設了大量鐵絲網。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "人數。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "九人，大致位置已標記在了小隊的終端上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "檢查站進入儲藏室的長廊入口完全封死了，無人機無法進一步深入。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "彙報完畢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "還有其他入口嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "沒有看到入口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "好，我會解決。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "有什麼建議嗎，Lord？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "燃燒榴彈還有剩餘，你要用幾顆？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "兩發。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "瞭解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "檢查站入口的阻塞太龐雜了，如果爆破，瓦礫會對突入造成很大影響。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "我的計劃是炸開牆體上方和右側的牆面，一個人掛繩在上方提供火力壓制，剩餘人員從右側缺口突入。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Frost，壓制和支援交給你來辦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "收到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "貼片炸藥爆炸後，Tachanka，你從上方缺口拋射榴彈，其他人按照標識位置投擲閃光彈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "地面突入按照Blitz、Ash、Tachanka的順序來，行動要緊湊，不留可趁之機。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "有問題就現在提出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "都確認了？那好，各自就位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Frost，等你的信號，然後我們開始行動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "正在前往預定位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "貼片炸藥部署完畢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "炸藥部署完畢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "準備——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "閃光彈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "榴彈已射出！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "突入！突入！突入！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "敵人倒下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Blitz，兩點鐘方向！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "已投擲手榴彈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "十點鐘，機槍手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "我來壓制，你們繼續推進！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "榴彈已射出！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "工事已破壞！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "壞傢伙倒了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "還有三個，正前方！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "兩個！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "已淨空！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "已淨空！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "已淨空！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "已淨空！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "有人受傷嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "好，我們繼續前進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Frost，注意警戒後方！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "收到！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "我來開門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Blitz，警戒。Tachanka，用無人機看一下走廊和儲藏室的情況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "已經在做了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "前面怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "儲藏室裡堆滿了彈藥補給，他們在這裡駐紮了有一段時間了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "材料室裡沒有敵人，只有幾個在培養皿中的黑色結晶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "有威脅嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "不好判斷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "這些罐子裡是什麼東西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "發光的礦物晶體，以前沒見過這種東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "礦石，合成物，只要它在發光，就可能有放射性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "別擔心，蓋革計數器沒有反應。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "那就直接穿過去，先不管這些石頭了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "各位，沒時間可以浪費了，行動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Ash，這裡是Iana。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "我們剛剛解決了敵人，但是他們用大量障礙物堵住了走廊通道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "我們要換一條路向核心區靠攏，完畢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "我們正在準備進入主實驗室，請儘快支援，完畢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "收到，Iana通訊完畢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "怎麼辦，需要等一等她們嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "不，時間緊急，不宜拖延，繼續前進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "前面就是主實驗室大門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "準備好，我們直接進去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "注意警戒，看到目標優先制服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "別駐足太久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "這裡沒有人，只有這些奇怪的機器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "別放鬆警惕，這裡的實驗器材還在運作，說明目標人物還在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "那我們得先真正進入到實驗室裡才行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "這裡是實驗室內的控制室，看到玻璃那邊的器械了嗎？那兒才是真正進行實驗的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "當心......這裡的敵人數量還不明朗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "text": "不受歡迎的朋友們總是不請自來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "（發現目標，先別開槍。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "（報告周圍情況。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "（沒發現其他人。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "（沒有看到其他敵人。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "把手舉起來，列維博士，離開終端機。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "text": "我還在想你們要多久才會出現。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "text": "你們幹掉了我的保安？真是太遺憾了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "text": "我昨天才給他們結了薪水。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "text": "不過煩請各位輕拿輕放，這裡的易碎品很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "不要輕舉妄動，這場鬧劇結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "text": "結束了？我的新實驗才剛剛開始。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "停下你的當前動作......我不會警告第二次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈，如果我拒絕呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "text": "怎麼，你在恐懼一個年老體弱，手無寸鐵的普通人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "你可不是什麼手無寸鐵的“普通人”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "你是磁山二號實驗室的首席科學家，列維·克里奇科。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "不准靠近那些設備。我知道你想幹什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Blitz，把他的手銬起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "收到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "text": "我得說，你們的動作非常快......快到令人敬佩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "text": "但是還不夠快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "反應堆啟動了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "這些黑色的石頭在發光！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "讓它停下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "text": "不好意思，這可做不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "讓它停下來！立刻！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "text": "哈哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈......哈哈哈哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "text": "它不會停下的，你就儘管開槍吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "text": "我一生的心血都傾注在這個項目上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "text": "如果不是因為那些目光短淺的無能之輩一次又一次的阻撓......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "text": "二十年前，我就該完成這一切了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "你根本不知道自己在做什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "這個實驗室裡的設備破舊不堪，你正在製造一場核污染災難！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "text": "我當然知道我在做什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "text": "探索科學的道路充滿艱難險阻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "text": "但是探索是值得的，對真理的探尋絕對值得，永遠都值得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "text": "我不過是要拿回那早在二十年前就應當屬於我的成果，誰都別想阻止我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......該死的雇傭兵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_162",
      "text": "你還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_161",
      "text": "呃，只是抱怨一下，剛才差一點就被打到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_161",
      "text": "我們本可以和其他幹員一起進入主實驗室的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_162",
      "text": "現在也不晚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_162",
      "text": "控制室就在前面了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_161",
      "text": "什麼聲音？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_162",
      "text": "？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_162",
      "text": "地震？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_161",
      "text": "不，是主實驗室！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_161",
      "text": "準備好複製器，他們可能碰上麻煩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_161",
      "text": "這，怎麼回事？！他們人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_162",
      "text": "這......這是什麼情況？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_161",
      "text": "不對，實驗室呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_161",
      "text": "地圖呢？這個巨大的空洞是怎麼回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_162",
      "text": "地圖不會有錯，這扇門背後就是主實驗室沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_162",
      "text": "整個實驗室......憑空消失了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "......醒，快......醒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "寇恩，你還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "寇恩？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "讓我來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "這可真神奇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "只是按了幾下穴位，幫助她恢復。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "發......發生了什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "亞歷山大，她醒了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "幹得漂亮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "你還好嗎，寇恩？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "這裡是什麼地方......出什麼事了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "這個問題問得好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "......列維啟動了設備之後，整個實驗室都被劇烈的衝擊波席捲了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "這裡是......什麼地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "我們現在在哪？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "不清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "目標人物啟動了不明實驗裝置，衝擊波把我們所有人推開了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "醒來之後再看到的情況，全都如你所見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "沒有信號，聯繫不上Ela和Iana。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "指南針也失效了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "我唯一能肯定的是，現在我們絕對不在任務原定區域。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "雖然這樣描述很不嚴謹，但我們就像是，和控制室一起被瞬間......傳送......到了某個地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "她說得沒錯，我們就像是突然被火箭發射到了月球上，這句話可不是開玩笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "需要我偵察嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "不，不要妄動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "瞭解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "列維·克里奇科如果也被卷了進來，那他應該也和我們處於相同狀況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "先恢復體力，我來規劃後續行動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "說說好消息吧，那些傭兵的補給也和我們一起被丟過來了，至少短時間不用太擔心彈藥問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "壞消息呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "壞消息就是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "......這又是什麼聲音？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "當心，牆外有什麼東西在靠近！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "聽上去像是重型工業機械......但這速度太靈活了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "讓我看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "......我真不敢相信我的眼睛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "*粗口*，我們麻煩大了！準備戰鬥！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "你到底看到了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "你見過小轎車一樣大的節肢動物嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "你說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "哦幹！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "現在算是見到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "開火！！快開火！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Blitz！往後退！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "額啊啊啊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "我的盾牌！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "子彈打不穿它的殼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "要是這個石頭大螃蟹把控制室的牆撕開，我們就完蛋了！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "穿甲彈有效！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "但是射它的腿沒用！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "那就讓它進來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "停火！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "讓它把牆打開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "Blitz，你還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "呃，沒受傷，只是裝備壞了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "好傢伙，這麼大個窟窿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "待會向它索賠的時候，記得把殼剝下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "Ash，快說你的計劃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "算不上計劃，但選項只剩這個了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "現在只有你的彈藥能對它造成傷害了，可能再加上我的榴彈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "我還剩......一發。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "在它撕開牆壁的瞬間動手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "根據穿甲彈的殺傷效果判斷，這發榴彈能炸斷它的腿，但願這能讓它暴露腹部。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "然後，就要靠你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "如果各位有更好的建議，請踴躍發言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "意見搜集結束了！準備！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "換彈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "這是什麼鬼東西！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "啊，這算是可以喘口氣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "哈——呼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "哇哦，剛才可真險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "這裡真的還是地球嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "我是指，我們熟悉的那個星球？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "沒理由覺得不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "但我們要做好最壞的準備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "牆徹底塌了，這裡已經連掩體都算不上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "轉移吧，直到我們找到能落腳的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
